    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even that feels like a lie. 'noticing things' feels like just distracting myself from the fact that i'm suffering for no reason. if there's no point to the pain, and no point to the joy, and it all just disappears into nothingness anyway... why am i even bothering to keep going through the motions? it feels so exhausting to fight against a vacuum that doesn't even know i exist.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
